# Test-only stand-in for acpi.svc (tests/headless, firmware-snapshot): offers
# the "acpi" catalog service exactly as acpi.svc does (registration
# notification, then REGISTER_DRIVER for DRIVER_ACPI) and reports the badge
# every request carries. Never part of a production image: procmgr lets
# com.cubit.acpi register only from the startup plan.
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "com.cubit.acpi"
  version => "0.0.1"
  requests => [
    (notification "acpi" Notify_Access.Manage "registration")])
